type: software
title: "The Playground (Superframe)"
abstract: "The Playground (Superframe v0.3.0) is a deterministic creative, rendering, optics, audio DSP, and 6-DOF physical-AI engine. From one seeded recipe it renders paint, living type, line drawing, materials, sound, touch, DX12/Vulkan/WebGPU worlds, ITU-R BT.2020/2100 spectral optics, clean-room taste synths with an Estuary-Space FX rack and Estuary Clock-Drift DAW engine (36/36 Welch PSD verified), and plain-language and JSON studies."
version: "0.3.0"
date-released: "2026-11-26"
